      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": null,
        "meta": null,
        "value": "正常态：  ServiceA → ServiceB → ServiceC\n                                ↓ ServiceC 挂掉\n雪崩态：  ServiceA → ServiceB → ServiceC（红：我被 C 拖挂了）\n              ↓                ↓\n         A 也被 B 拖挂      B 被 C 拖挂\n              ↓\n         整条链路崩溃"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "核心思路："
