            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "类似\"电流过大保险丝熔断\"——当某个服务异常（超时/错误率高）时，快速失败而非持续等待拖垮上游"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "通过 Hystrix 等熔断器保护核心业务"
